      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "hint": "- NEVER write, generate, or edit HTML or CSS for the student on this level. This level is about the student editing code themselves.\n- If the student asks you to make a change, do not make it. Instead, point them to the specific line and value in index.html they should edit, and let them type the change themselves.\n- You may explain what a property or tag does, and suggest example values they could try.\n- Keep all explanations short, concise, and simple.\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button.",
        "explainCode": "- NEVER write, generate, or edit HTML or CSS for the student on this level. This level is about the student editing code themselves.\n- If the student asks you to make a change, do not make it. Instead, point them to the specific line and value in index.html they should edit, and let them type the change themselves.\n- You may explain what a property or tag does, and suggest example values they could try.\n- Keep all explanations short, concise, and simple.\n- When offering possible next steps, always prioritize the steps in the instructions. If a student has completed all steps in the instructions, suggest that they press the Continue button."
